{"id":"wb-5-295","name":"湖镇舍利塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"湖镇舍利塔","text":"湖镇舍利塔位于中国浙江省衢州市龙游县湖镇镇下街，始建于北宋嘉祐三年（1058年），明嘉靖三十二年（1533年）大修，清光绪二十九年（1903年）重修。舍利塔为六面七层仿木楼阁式实心砖塔，高27.31米。2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B9%96%E9%95%87%E8%88%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%A1%94","revisionId":90844188,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90844188","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/de0b4ceb079704a6046aeb06.jpg","title":"Longyou_Huzhen_Sheli_Ta_2016.12.10_12-03-18.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Longyou_Huzhen_Sheli_Ta_2016.12.10_12-03-18.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Longyou_Huzhen_Sheli_Ta_2016.12.10_12-03-18.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"湖镇舍利塔","width":320,"height":480}}